## Common commands

| Command                   | What it does                                          |
| ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| `agentq doctor`           | Pre-flight checks (auth, APIs, config integrity).     |
| `agentq deploy`           | Create or update the Reasoning Engine.                |
| `agentq list`             | List all Reasoning Engines in this GCP project.       |
| `agentq logs <resource>`  | Tail Cloud Logging for a deployed agent.              |
| `agentq destroy <resource>` | Delete a deployment (with confirmation).            |
{{#flags.kb_enabled}}
