## File handling (uploaded files in AgentQ)

This project ships with two ready-made tools that let the agent read files
the user attaches to the conversation:

| Tool                        | Purpose                                              |
| --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| `list_uploaded_files()`     | Returns every file currently attached to the chat.   |
| `read_uploaded_file(name)`  | Returns extracted text content for the given file.   |

Supported formats out of the box: **PDF, DOCX, XLSX/XLSM, CSV/TSV, JSON,
Markdown, plain text, source code, YAML/TOML/INI, HTML/XML**.

Adding more formats is one decorator call in
`src/{{project.package}}/tools/file_readers.py`:

```python
@register(".epub")
def _read_epub(data: bytes) -> str:
    ...
```

The agent's instruction already tells it when to use these tools — read
`agent.py` for the wording.

