## Customising deployment

The CLI runs a uniform deploy across every AgentQ project. If this project
needs additional setup or tear-down — e.g. populating a BigQuery table or
rotating a secret — implement it in `scripts/deploy_hooks.py` and reference
it under `hooks:` in `agentq.config.yaml`. The hooks receive the loaded
config and run inside the deploy pipeline.

## Registering for AgentQ users

After `agentq deploy`, copy the printed `resource_name` and register it in
**Gemini Enterprise → Agent Designer → New custom agent → Use existing
reasoning engine**. The agent will then appear inside AgentQ.
